  "acceptance": [
    "Desktop and mini-window structure follow the selected Focus Dock concept.",
    "Mini-window dark and light themes share layout and preserve readable provider colors.",
    "The cost view is replaced by subscription-model information; no estimated bill is inferred from quota percentages.",
    "Settings remains accessible in the initial viewport; mini-window actions have native implementations.",
    "History displays real collected samples for today, 7 days and 30 days; missing history is not fabricated.",
    "Antigravity model groups remain distinct from the direct Claude subscription.",
    "Provider names and numeric usage data remain readable without relying on color alone.",
    "Approved images contain example data and are visual targets, not evidence of installed runtime behavior.",
    "Figma packages, URLs, plugins, and runtime APIs are not required to run or verify the project."
